      "preview": "חוֹל: areia.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חוֹל</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Hosea 2:1\" href=\"/Hosea.2.1\">Ho 2:1</a></sup> <strong>areia (</strong>talvez enquanto se volta ou <em>gira;</em> explicada de outro modo por Sta, ver sob <a data-ref=\"BDB, חֲוִילָה\" href=\"/BDB,_חֲוִילָה\", dir=\"rtl\">חֲוִילָה</a>; hebraico pós-bíblico <em>idem.</em>, aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">חָלָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܳܠܴܐ</span> <strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> absoluto <a data-ref=\"Genesis 22:17\" href=\"/Genesis.22.17\">Gn 22:17</a> + 15 vezes; construto <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:13\" href=\"/Genesis.32.13\">Gn 32:13</a> + 6 vezes;—<em>areia</em> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 2:12\" href=\"/Exodus.2.12\">Ex 2:12</a> (E); posta como limite para o mar <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 5:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.5.22\">Je 5:22</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂפֻנֵי טמוני ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.19\">Dt 33:19</a> <em>tesouros ocultos da areia</em>, poeticamente por <em>vidro</em> (considerado misteriosamente produzido da areia, ver Di e referências);<br><strong>a.</strong>  geralmente areia da praia, símile de quantidade inumerável, vastidão, assim da descendência de Abraão <a data-ref=\"Genesis 22:17\" href=\"/Genesis.22.17\">Gn 22:17</a> (J; cf. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 15:5\" href=\"/Genesis.15.5\">15:5</a>); de Jacó <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:13\" href=\"/Genesis.32.13\">32:13</a> (E); de uma hoste <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:4\" href=\"/Joshua.11.4\">Jos 11:4</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"Judges 7:12\" href=\"/Judges.7.12\">Ju 7:12</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.5\">1 S 13:5</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:11\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.11\">2 S 17:11</a>; de um povo <a data-ref=\"I Kings 4:20\" href=\"/I_Kings.4.20\">1 K 4:20</a> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 2:1\" href=\"/Hosea.2.1\">Ho 2:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.22\">Is 10:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 48:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.48.19\">48:19</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">וְצֶאֱצָאֵי מֵעֶיךָ בִּמְעֹתָ֑יו</span>), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 33:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.33.22\">Je 33:22</a> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:9\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.9\">Hb 1:9</a>; do cereal ajuntado por José <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:49\" href=\"/Genesis.41.49\">Gn 41:49</a>; dos dias de Jó <a data-ref=\"Job 29:18\" href=\"/Job.29.18\">Jb 29:18</a> (sobre interpretação = <em>fênix</em>, ver Di); das aves <span dir=\"rtl\">עוף כנף</span> (isto é, codornizes) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:27\" href=\"/Psalms.78.27\">ψ 78:27</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כֶּעָפָר</span>); da vasta extensão da sabedoria de Salomão <a data-ref=\"I Kings 5:9\" href=\"/I_Kings.5.9\">1 K 5:9</a>.<br><strong>b.</strong>  em comparação, <em>mais que a areia</em> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 15:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.15.8\">Je 15:8</a> (viúvas de Judá); pensamentos de Deus <a data-ref=\"Psalms 139:18\" href=\"/Psalms.139.18\">ψ 139:18</a>.<br><strong>c.</strong>  de peso (em balanças), metáfora da aflição de Jó <span dir=\"rtl\">(כַּעַשׂ)</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 6:3\" href=\"/Job.6.3\">Jb 6:3</a> <em>mais pesada que a</em> areia, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְנֵטֶל הַחוֹל</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 27:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.27.3\">Pr 27:3</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כֹּבֶד אֶבֶן</span>), dito de <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּעַס אֱוִיל</span>.—As combinações são: <span dir=\"rtl\">כח׳ אשׁר על שׂפת הים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 22:17\" href=\"/Genesis.22.17\">Gn 22:17</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:4\" href=\"/Joshua.11.4\">Jos 11:4</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.5\">1 S 13:5</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 5:9\" href=\"/I_Kings.5.9\">1 K 5:9</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כח׳ הַיָּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:13\" href=\"/Genesis.32.13\">Gn 32:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:49\" href=\"/Genesis.41.49\">41:49</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.22\">Is 10:22</a> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 2:1\" href=\"/Hosea.2.1\">Ho 2:1</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">אשׁר לא יִמַּד ולא יִסָּפֵר</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ הַיָּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 33:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.33.22\">Je 33:22</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כח׳ שֶׁעַל־שׂפת הים לרב</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 7:12\" href=\"/Judges.7.12\">Ju 7:12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כח׳ אשׁר־על־הים לרב</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:11\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.11\">2 S 17:11</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 4:20\" href=\"/I_Kings.4.20\">1 K 4:20</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">(ם)חול יַמִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 6:3\" href=\"/Job.6.3\">Jb 6:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:27\" href=\"/Psalms.78.27\">ψ 78:27</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 15:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.15.8\">Je 15:8</a>.",
