      "preview": "חֵל: baluarte, fortaleza.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֵל</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵיל</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:20\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.20\">Ob 20</a></sup> <strong>baluarte, fortaleza (</strong>talvez originalmente <em>muralha circundante</em>, cf. Sab. Denkm <sup>91 n.2</sup><strong>)</strong>—absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵיל</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:8\" href=\"/Nahum.3.8\">Na 3:8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:8\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.8\">La 2:8</a> + 3 vezes (+ <a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:10\" href=\"/Psalms.10.10\">ψ 10:10</a> Qere ver <span dir=\"rtl\">חלכה</span>); construto <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 21:23\" href=\"/I_Kings.21.23\">1 K 21:23</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵילֵךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 122:7\" href=\"/Psalms.122.7\">ψ 122:7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵילָהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 9:4\" href=\"/Zechariah.9.4\">Zc 9:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵילָה</span> = <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵילָהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 48:11\" href=\"/Psalms.48.11\">ψ 48:11</a>, Ol<sup>§ 40 c. 75 g. 96 e</sup> Sta<sup>§ 347 c</sup>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>baluarte</em> (definido pelos judeus como <span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּן חוֹמָה</span>, isto é, uma pequena muralha, cf. Ki sob o verbete), de uma fortificação externa <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:15\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.15\">2 S 20:15</a> (outros, por metonímia, do espaço entre as fortificações externa e interna, incluindo o fosso, ver Dr Kit); <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 26:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.26.1\">Is 26:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:8\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.8\">La 2:8</a> (ambos ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חוֹמוֹת</span>); em geral das defesas, ou poder marítimo de Tiro <span dir=\"rtl\">וְהִכָּה בַיָּם חֵילָהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 9:4\" href=\"/Zechariah.9.4\">Zc 9:4</a> (ver Sta<sup>ZAW i. 1881, 15</sup>), de No-Amom (Tebas) <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲשֶׁר חֵיל יָם מִיָּם חוֹמָתָהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:8\" href=\"/Nahum.3.8\">Na 3:8</a>; de Sião <a data-ref=\"Psalms 122:7\" href=\"/Psalms.122.7\">ψ 122:7</a>, também <a data-ref=\"Psalms 48:14\" href=\"/Psalms.48.14\">48:14</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">חילה</span> = <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵילָהּ</span>, cf. acima; ambos ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">ארמנותיך</span>).—Por <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 21:23\" href=\"/I_Kings.21.23\">1 K 21:23</a> ler provavelmente <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵלֶק</span>, ver respectivo verbete.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>fortaleza</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּלֻת הַחֵל הַזֶּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:20\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.20\">Ob 20</a> <em>os exilados desta fortaleza</em> (Hi-St; Or AVRV <em>este exército</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵל</span> = <span dir=\"rtl\">חַיִל</span>).",
