      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חוּם</span></big>  <strong>adjetivo: escurecido, castanho-escuro</strong> ou <strong>preto</strong>, somente da cor de ovelhas (em <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30\" href=\"/Genesis.30\">Gn 30</a>, J);—<span dir=\"rtl\">וכל־שֶׂה־חוּם בכשׂבים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:32\" href=\"/Genesis.30.32\">Gn 30:32</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וְחוּם בכ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:33\" href=\"/Genesis.30.33\">Gn 30:33</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:35\" href=\"/Genesis.30.35\">35</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וכל־חוּם בְּצֹאן</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:40\" href=\"/Genesis.30.40\">Gn 30:40</a> (oração provavelmente interpolada Ol Hup De We Di).",
