      "preview": "חוּס: ter piedade, olhar com compaixão.",
      "html": "† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">חוּס</span>]</big>  <strong>verbo: ter piedade, olhar com compaixão (</strong>aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܳܣ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חוּס</span> <em>ter piedade, poupar;</em> assírio <em>ḫûs</em>, em nome próprio cf. Dl<sup>Pr 181</sup><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Perfeito 3.ª pessoa feminina singular <span dir=\"rtl\">חָסָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.5\">Ez 16:5</a>, 2.ª pessoa masculina singular <span dir=\"rtl\">חַ֫סְתָּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jonah 4:10\" href=\"/Jonah.4.10\">Jon 4:10</a>; imperfeito 3.ª pessoa masculina singular <span dir=\"rtl\">יָחוּס</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 21:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.21.7\">Je 21:7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יָחֹס</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 72:13\" href=\"/Psalms.72.13\">ψ 72:13</a>; 3.ª pessoa feminina singular <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּחוּס</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.18\">Is 13:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּחוֹס</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 7:16\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.7.16\">Dt 7:16</a> + 9 vezes (Ges<sup>§ 72 R 4</sup> Bö<sup>§ 1133 (2)</sup>); <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּחֹס</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 45:20\" href=\"/Genesis.45.20\">Gn 45:20</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 9:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.9.5\">Ez 9:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתָּ֫חָס</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 24:11\" href=\"/I_Samuel.24.11\">1 S 24:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 20:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.20.17\">Ez 20:17</a>; 1.ª pessoa singular <span dir=\"rtl\">אָחוּס</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.14\">Je 13:14</a> + 2 vezes; imperativo <span dir=\"rtl\">חוּ֫סָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:17\" href=\"/Joel.2.17\">Jo 2:17</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:22\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.22\">Ne 13:22</a>:— <strong>a.</strong>  do olho, <span dir=\"rtl\">עין</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תח(ו)ס על (לא)</span> o olho <em>olhará</em> (<em>não</em>) <em>com compaixão para, terá piedade de</em> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 7:16\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.7.16\">Dt 7:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 13:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.13.9\">13:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 19:13\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.19.13\">19:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.18\">Is 13:18</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 7:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.7.4\">Ez 7:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 20:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.20.17\">20:17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לא חסה עָלַיִךְ עין</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.5\">Ez 16:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵינְכֶם אַל־תָּחֹס עַל־כְּלֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 45:20\" href=\"/Genesis.45.20\">Gn 45:20</a> (R<sup>JE</sup>) <em>não olhe vosso olho com pesar para vossos bens;</em> com elipse de <span dir=\"rtl\">עַיִן</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 24:11\" href=\"/I_Samuel.24.11\">1 S 24:11</a> (mas ler <span dir=\"rtl\">וָאָחֻס</span> por <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתָּחָס</span> 𝔊 𝔖 We Klo Dr); com elipse de <span dir=\"rtl\">על</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 19:21\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.19.21\">Dt 19:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 25:12\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.25.12\">25:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 5:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.5.11\">Ez 5:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 7:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.7.9\">7:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 8:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.8.18\">8:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 9:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.9.10\">9:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ע֯ל תחס עיני֯כם (אל)</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 9:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.9.5\">Ez 9:5</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  de Deus <span dir=\"rtl\">חוסה על</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:22\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.22\">Ne 13:22</a> <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:17\" href=\"/Joel.2.17\">Jo 2:17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לא אחוס על נינוה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jonah 4:11\" href=\"/Jonah.4.11\">Jon 4:11</a>; elipse de <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.14\">Je 13:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.14\">Ez 24:14</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  do homem: o rei messiânico <span dir=\"rtl\">על־דַּל וְאֶבְיוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 72:13\" href=\"/Psalms.72.13\">ψ 72:13</a> <em>terá piedade do pobre e do necessitado;</em> Nabucodonosor <span dir=\"rtl\">עליהם</span> (isto é, de Zedequias e do povo) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 21:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.21.7\">Je 21:7</a>; Jonas, <span dir=\"rtl\">על חקיקיון</span> <a data-ref=\"Jonah 4:10\" href=\"/Jonah.4.10\">Jon 4:10</a>.—Ver também <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, חָמַל\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_חָמַל\">חמל</a>.",
