      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חָזֶה</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Leviticus 7:31\" href=\"/Leviticus.7.31\">Lv 7:31</a></sup> <strong>peito</strong> de animais <strong>(</strong>aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܰܕܝܳܐ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חַדְיָא</span><strong>)</strong>—absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:26\" href=\"/Exodus.29.26\">Ex 29:26</a> + 4 vezes; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲזֵה</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:27\" href=\"/Exodus.29.27\">Ex 29:27</a> + 5 vezes; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">חָזוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 9:20\" href=\"/Leviticus.9.20\">Lv 9:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 9:21\" href=\"/Leviticus.9.21\">21</a>—<em>peito</em>, somente P, e somente de animais sacrificiais; sempre como oferta movida; do carneiro da consagração <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:26\" href=\"/Exodus.29.26\">Ex 29:26</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:27\" href=\"/Exodus.29.27\">27</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 8:29\" href=\"/Leviticus.8.29\">Lv 8:29</a>, da oferta pacífica <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 7:30\" href=\"/Leviticus.7.30\">Lv 7:30</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 7:30\" href=\"/Leviticus.7.30\">30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 9:20\" href=\"/Leviticus.9.20\">9:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 9:21\" href=\"/Leviticus.9.21\">21</a>, do sacrifício nazireu <a data-ref=\"Numbers 6:20\" href=\"/Numbers.6.20\">Nu 6:20</a>; porção devida a Arão e seus filhos <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 7:31\" href=\"/Leviticus.7.31\">Lv 7:31</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 7:34\" href=\"/Leviticus.7.34\">34</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 10:14\" href=\"/Leviticus.10.14\">10:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 10:15\" href=\"/Leviticus.10.15\">15</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:18\" href=\"/Numbers.18.18\">Nu 18:18</a>.",
