      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֲזִיז</span></big>  <strong>substantivo.</strong>[<strong>masculino.</strong>] raio, <strong>relâmpago (</strong>hebraico pós-bíblico <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲזִיז</span>; aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲזִיזָא</span> <em>nuvem luminosa</em><strong>)</strong>—somente construto <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲזִיז</span> e plural <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲזִיזִים</span>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְדֶרֶךְ לַחֲזִיז קֹלוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 28:26\" href=\"/Job.28.26\">Jb 28:26</a> <em>e um caminho para os raios</em> = <a data-ref=\"Job 38:25\" href=\"/Job.38.25\">38:25</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳ עֹשֶׂה חֲזִיזִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 10:1\" href=\"/Zechariah.10.1\">Zc 10:1</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מְטַר־גֶּשֶׁם</span>).",
