      "headword": "חִזְקִיָּ֫הוּ",
      "ref": "BDB, חִזְקִיָּ֫הוּ",
      "preview": "חִזְקִיָּ֫הוּ: nome próprio masculino: Ezequias.",
      "html": "<big><span dir=\"rtl\">חִזְקִיָּ֫הוּ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חִזְקִיָּה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יְחִזְקִיָּ֫הוּ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יְחִזְקִיָּה</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio masculino. (</strong><span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>fortaleceu</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>fortalece;</em> = assírio <em>Ḫazaḳi(i)au</em>, Schr<sup> COT</sup> sobre <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:1\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.1\">2 K 18:1 ff.</a>, Jäger<sup> BAS i, 469</sup>; cf. nome próprio <span dir=\"rtl\">יחזק</span> em selo Gann<sup> JAs 1883 Feb.–Mar., 134 No. 7</sup>;—sobre a formação ver Lag<sup>BN 134</sup><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  𝔊 Εζεκιας, <em>filho de Acaz</em>, rei de Judá, raramente †<span dir=\"rtl\">חִזְקִיָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:1\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.1\">2 K 18:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:10\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:14\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.14\">14</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:15\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:16\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.16\">16</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, também <span dir=\"rtl\">אַנְשֵׁי ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 25:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.25.1\">Pr 25:1</a> †; nas demais passagens em 2Rs (exceto <a data-ref=\"II Kings 20:10\" href=\"/II_Kings.20.10\">20:10</a>) <span dir=\"rtl\">חִזְקִיָּהוּ</span>: <a data-ref=\"II Kings 16:20\" href=\"/II_Kings.16.20\">16:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:9\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.9\">18:9</a> + 34 vezes, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18-21\" href=\"/II_Kings.18-21\">2 K 18–21</a> ‖ <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 36:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.36.1\">Is 36:1</a> + 31 vezes, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 36-39\" href=\"/Isaiah.36-39\">Is 36–39</a>; também †<a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 26:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.26.18\">Je 26:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 26:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.26.19\">19</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:13\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.13\">1 Ch 3:13</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:18\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.18\">2 Ch 29:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:27\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.27\">27</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 30:24\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.30.24\">30:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 32:15\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.32.15\">32:15</a>; em Cr geralmente <span dir=\"rtl\">יְחִזְקִיָּהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:41\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.41\">1 Ch 4:41</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 28:27\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.28.27\">2 Ch 28:27</a> + 35 vezes <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29-33\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29-33\">2 Ch 29–33</a>; também <a data-ref=\"II Kings 20:10\" href=\"/II_Kings.20.10\">2 K 20:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 15:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.15.4\">Je 15:4</a>, e no título <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.1\">Is 1:1</a>; †<span dir=\"rtl\">יִחִזְקִיָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 1:1\" href=\"/Hosea.1.1\">Ho 1:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Micah 1:1\" href=\"/Micah.1.1\">Mi 1:1</a> †(se י nestes três não for erro textual por <span dir=\"rtl\">וְ</span>).<br>†<strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">חִזְקִיָּה</span> trisavô do profeta Sofonias <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 1:1\" href=\"/Zephaniah.1.1\">Zp 1:1</a>, 𝔊 τοῦ Εζεκιου, talvez = <strong>1.</strong><br>†<strong>3.</strong>  𝔊 Εζεκια(ς), <span dir=\"rtl\">חִזְקִיָּה</span> homem da linhagem real davídica <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.23\">1 Ch 3:23</a> provavelmente próximo da época do cronista.<br>†<strong>4.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְחִזְקִיָּה</span>, 𝔊 Εζεκια(ς), chefe de uma família de exilados que regressaram <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:16\" href=\"/Ezra.2.16\">Ezr 2:16</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">חִזְקִיָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:20\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.20\">Ne 7:21</a>, cf. também <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:18\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.18\">Ne 10:18</a>.<br>†<strong>5.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְחִזְקִיָּהוּ</span> 𝔊 Εζεκιας, um efraimita, do tempo de Acaz <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 28:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.28.12\">2 Ch 28:12</a>.",
