      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֵטְא</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.9\">Dt 15:9</a></sup> <strong>pecado (</strong>sobre a formação ver Lag<sup>BN 142</sup><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:17\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.17\">Lv 19:17</a> + 15 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶטְאוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 24:15\" href=\"/Leviticus.24.15\">Lv 24:15</a> + 5 vezes, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲטָאָו֯</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:39\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.39\">La 3:39</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶטְאָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 20:20\" href=\"/Leviticus.20.20\">Lv 20:20</a>; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲטָאִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 10:4\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.10.4\">Ec 10:4</a>; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲטָאֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 10:29\" href=\"/II_Kings.10.29\">2 K 10:29</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:49\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.49\">Ez 23:49</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲטָאַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:9\" href=\"/Genesis.41.9\">Gn 41:9</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲטָאָ֑י</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 38:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.38.17\">Is 38:17</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 51:11\" href=\"/Psalms.51.11\">ψ 51:11</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲטָאֵינוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:16\" href=\"/Daniel.9.16\">Dn 9:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 103:10\" href=\"/Psalms.103.10\">ψ 103:10</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲטָאֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.18\">Is 1:18</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>pecado:</em> <strong>a.</strong>  contra o homem <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:9\" href=\"/Genesis.41.9\">Gn 41:9</a> (E) <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 10:4\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.10.4\">Ec 10:4</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  nas demais passagens contra Deus, absoluto <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 31:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.31.7\">Is 31:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 12:9\" href=\"/Hosea.12.9\">Ho 12:9</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ חָטָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:8\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.8\">La 1:8</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 19:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.19.15\">Dt 19:15</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 10:29\" href=\"/II_Kings.10.29\">2 K 10:29</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ משׁפט מות</span> <em>pecado</em> digno de morte <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 21:22\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.21.22\">Dt 21:22</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ מות</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 22:26\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.22.26\">22:26</a>; com <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span>, <em>por causa de</em>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:16\" href=\"/Daniel.9.16\">Dn 9:16</a>; suplica-se a Deus: <em>esconde teu rosto dos meus pecados</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 51:11\" href=\"/Psalms.51.11\">ψ 51:11</a>; e diz-se com fé, <em>lançarás para trás de tuas costas todos os meus pecados</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 38:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.38.17\">Is 38:17</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>culpa do pecado:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">היה חטא ב</span> <em>pecado</em> (a culpa do pecado) <em>sobrevir a alguém</em> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.9\">Dt 15:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:22\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.22\">23:22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:23\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.23\">23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 24:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.24.15\">24:15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בחטאו מת</span> <em>em seu pecado</em> (culpa) <em>morrer</em> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 27:3\" href=\"/Numbers.27.3\">Nu 27:3</a> (P); <span dir=\"rtl\">אישׁ בחטאו</span> <em>cada um pelo próprio pecado</em> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 24:16\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.24.16\">Dt 24:16</a> + <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:16\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.16\">2 K 14:16</a> + <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.4\">2 Ch 25:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בחטא יחמתני אמי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 51:7\" href=\"/Psalms.51.7\">ψ 51:7</a> <em>em pecado</em> (condição de pecado e culpa) <em>minha mãe me concebeu;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">אם חטאיכם כשׁנים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.18\">Is 1:18</a> <em>ainda que vossos pecados sejam como escarlata</em>(quanto à culpa); <span dir=\"rtl\">לא כחטאינו עשׂה לנו</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 103:10\" href=\"/Psalms.103.10\">ψ 103:10</a> <em>não segundo nossos pecados</em> (sua culpa) <em>nos tratou</em>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>punição pelo pecado:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">נשׂא ח׳</span> <em>levar o pecado</em> (sua punição) <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 20:20\" href=\"/Leviticus.20.20\">Lv 20:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 24:15\" href=\"/Leviticus.24.15\">24:15</a> (H), <a data-ref=\"Numbers 9:13\" href=\"/Numbers.9.13\">Nu 9:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:22\" href=\"/Numbers.18.22\">18:22</a> (P); com <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span>, <em>levar o pecado por causa de</em> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:17\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.17\">Lv 19:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:9\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.9\">22:9</a> (H) <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:32\" href=\"/Numbers.18.32\">Nu 18:32</a> (P); levar os pecados dos ídolos (ao adorar ídolos) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:49\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.49\">Ez 23:49</a>; o servo ideal de Yahweh <em>levou os pecados de muitos</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 53:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.53.12\">Is 53:12</a>; sem <span dir=\"rtl\">נשׂא</span>, somente <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:39\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.39\">La 3:39</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">גבר על חטאו</span> (por que) <em>um homem</em> (se queixa) <em>da punição de seu pecado?</em>",
